git add docs/raceday_database.sql
git commit -m "feat(database): create Participants table with age support

Added Participants table:

Participants Table Structure:
- ParticipantID INT IDENTITY(1,1) PRIMARY KEY
- FullName NVARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
- Email NVARCHAR(150) NOT NULL UNIQUE
- PasswordHash NVARCHAR(255) NOT NULL
- DateOfBirth DATE NULL (for age-category checks)
- PhoneNumber NVARCHAR(20) NULL
- CreatedAt DATETIME DEFAULT GETDATE()

Why separate from Organisers:
- Participants need DateOfBirth for age eligibility
- Different permissions in the system
- Cleaner database with no NULL columns
- Easier role-based access enforcement

This fulfills the requirement for two user tables.

This is commit #13 of 20."
